SUMMARY:Raffaella
LOCATION:Lucinda's\, East Village
DESCRIPTION:Over the past six years NYC native Raffaella has been living in
 
 Minneapolis and writing her debut album - a midwestern-soaked meditation o
 
n faith\, belonging\, and the beauty of believing without proof. On October
 
 22nd\, she's coming home to share it with us. Not only will she give us a 
 
sneak peak performance of the whole record\, but she will also hand out a f
 
ree CD to every ticket holder: \, "rdquo" -> Live music should be rewarded 
 
with analogue party favors - I want this to be an experience you can have a
 
nd then literally hold." As one of pop's sharpest observers of human behavi
 
or\, Raffaella pulls meaning out of weakness like a magnet and turns big ex
 
istential questions into something warm and lived-in. The record's first si
 
ngle\, Courtney\, is out now. Previous tours include opening for Samia\, Li
 
z Phair\, Del Water Gap and more. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com
 
/event/raffaella-lucindas-tickets/14338374
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/raffaella-lucindas-tickets/14338374
END:VEVENT
